# Netlify redirect rules
#
# When this app is deployed as a static site on Netlify, API calls must be
# proxied to the live API server.
#
# 1. Set the environment variable VITE_API_BASE_URL in Netlify
#    (Site settings → Environment variables) to your Replit production URL,
#    e.g.:  https://tanakh-reader.<your-username>.replit.app
#    Then trigger a redeploy — no _redirects proxy is needed.
#
# 2. Alternatively, uncomment the line below and replace the URL:
#
# /api/*  https://tanakh-reader.<your-username>.replit.app/api/:splat  200

# SPA fallback — all other routes render index.html
/*  /index.html  200
